<title>MALAYSIA: Malaysia Shell 1996 net up 50.6 pct.</title>
<headline>Malaysia Shell 1996 net up 50.6 pct.</headline>
<dateline>KUALA LUMPUR 1997-03-26</dateline>
<text>
<p>Year to Dec 31, 1996</p>
<p>		   (in million ringgit unless stated)</p>
<p>    Net profit		 112.04   vs	  74.39</p>
<p>    Shr	 (cents)	 37.3    vs	  24.8</p>
<p>    Turnover		 2,467.57   vs     2,088.75</p>
<p>    Pre-tax profit	   123.86   vs	  88.20</p>
<p>    Dividend  (cents)	 37.0    vs	  37.0</p>
<p>NOTE - Full name of the company is Shell Refining Co (FOM) Bhd.</p>
<p>-- Kuala Lumpur newsroom (603-201 4813)</p>
